[enu default]

// Ending Texts //

// (The Ultimate) Doom
E1TEXT =
	"The reward for my survival in this\n"
	"demon-infested base should be fair... Right?\n"
	"\n"
	"WRONG! The portal sent me to an isolated ambush zone,\n"
	"getting assaulted left and right by the demons.\n"
	"At least I managed to survive, but...\n"
	"Where am I? It smells like...\n"
	"Blood, sulfur, and death.\n"
	"\n"
	"Wherever I am, I'll make it through.\n"
	"Just like Kiri-kun did...\n"
	"\n"
	"To be continued in... THE SHORES OF HELL";
E2TEXT =
	"The augmented guardian let out his\n"
	"last roar before a massive explosion.\n"
	"\n"
	"...Now what?\n"
	"I need to rest, but I'm not in a safe area...\n"
	"But... What the...?!"
	"...\n"
	"Deimos floats above Hell itself??\n"
	"That's not possible...\n"
	"How did the UAC's experiments cause such...\n"
	"Abnormalities...?\n"
	"\n"
	"It doesn't matter. I have nowhere to go\n"
	"but down to the surface of Hell.\n"
	"\n"
	"To be continued in... INFERNO";
E3TEXT =
	"The remnants of the machine of spider demon\n"
	"I fought got charred and stained with her blood.\n"
	"...I assume that she's the mastermind of the\n"
	"assaults on Phobos and Deimos.\n"
	"\n"
	"The nearby wall lowered, revealing a portal.\n"
	"I have nowhere else to go, so...\n"
	"I heed the \"voice\" of Kiri-kun\n"
	"and step into the portal.\n"
	"\n"
	"...Now where am I?\n"
	"Is this... Home?\n"
	"I think I'm back home.\n"
	"I'm glad that the nightmare is over...\n"
	"I looked around for help, and...\n"
	"\n"
	"...I was wrong."
	"\n"
	"To be continued in... THY FLESH CONSUMED";
E4TEXT =
	"Again... dealing with those hellpigs...\n"
	"I thought I was finally done, but no!\n"
	"They invaded the Earth!\n"
	"\n"
	"The longer I kill, the more I get used to it,\n"
	"even more so than exterminating Kiri-kun's tormentors.\n"
	"\n"
	"They promised me my dead son, Kiritaka.\n"
	"Are they decieving me? Or will they keep their word...?\n"
	"\n"
	"Either way, I have to follow their \"demands\"...\n"
	"I step into yet another portal.\n"
	"\n"
	"Time to welcome Hell on Earth.";
// SIGIL
E5TEXT =
	"The demons sabotaged the portal back to Earth.\n"
	"Somehow, they didn't realize that taking me\n"
	"back home was a bad idea.\n"
	"\n"
	"I cleaned them up, yet again, staining the place with\n"
	"yet more of their blood...\n"
	"\n"
	"Will this portal send me back to Earth?";
// SIGIL II
E6TEXT =
	"Yet again, the demons hadn't figured out that\n"
	"pulling me back into the depths of Hell was not\n"
	"their best move.\n"
	"\n"
	"Now, they plan to invade the Earth with the rest\n"
	"of their demonic brethren, flooding it with hellspawn...\n"
	"They can only hope I go down fighting their hordes.\n"
	"\n"
	"This time, it's really going to be Hell on Earth!!";

//Doom II	
C1TEXT =
	"The world I knew changed drastically...\n"
	"How long have I been dead?\n"
	"It seems it's been... two decades???\n"
	"\n"
	"The world changed so much since I left...\n"
	"Either way, I need to move foward.\n"
	"\n"
	"I need to escape from this station\n"
	"as soon as possible!";
C2TEXT =
	"I'm out of the invaded station now...\n"
	"Thank God, humanity has been evacuated\n"
	"from Earth, to safe zones in space,\n"
	"as far as I've heard.\n"
	"\n"
	"Still, reports indicate massive casulties in the billions\n"
	"caused by those demonic invaders that I stuffed with lead.\n"
	"\n"
	"Now, I heard on the radio that the main source of the invasion\n"
	"is located at the center of the city.\n"
	"\n"
	"Guess I have to head there..."
	"For him. For all of humanity.";
C3TEXT =
	"I made it to the destination, the corrupted heart\n"
	"of the city, overrun by the demonic invaders.\n"
	"Their sulfur- and blood-stenched carcasses\n"
	"surround my path, over and over again.\n"
	"\n"
	"It looks like there's no way to destroy the portal,\n"
	"unless I destroy it from the inside...\n"
	"The path of perpetual torment is up ahead...\n"
	"\n"
	"Yet again.";
C4TEXT =
	"It's over.\n"
	"The titanic monstrosity has been demolished\n"
	"after I launched explosive after explosive\n"
	"into its brain.\n"
	"\n"
	"The loud roars of agony and the bright flashes of explosions\n"
	"deafened and blinded me to what was happening.\n"
	"And after a bright flash...\n"
	"\n"
	"I opened my eyes to an unusual land.\n"
	"I assumed this was the world I had been promised...\n"
	"And I was correct. They brought him back, as promised...\n"
	"Kiri-kun... I missed you so much.\n"
	"...THE END?\n";
C5TEXT =
	"Where am I?\n"
	"This place seems to be... Familiar.\n"
	"Wait... I know that insignia.\n"
	"\n"
	"Evil hasn't ravaged this place, but rather...\n"
	"it's owned by the evil...\n"
	"This place is related to those behind\n"
	"Kiri-kun's death, and the blaming of my family.\n"
	"\n"
	"Shizuka, Nozomu... The Okaya family...\n"
	"DAMN YOU TWO!";
C6TEXT =
	"The alternate path took me to ground level.\n"
	"I had a feeling that Shizuka's men were waiting for me to strike.\n"
	"Time to clean the garbage, yet again.\n";
